                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't put much stock into many of the negative reviews. This is a nice puzzle game.\n\nThe negative reviews are under a delusion that this is a $100 AAA title and are expecting days of complex gameplay from this game. This game is less than $1 and the game file is 26mb. \n\nRealistically speaking, this game knows what it is and is priced correctly. If you are looking for a quirky puzzle game for less than $1 this will serve you well.",
